      <h2 class="about__title" id="about-title">About</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="about__body">
      <p class="about__lead">
        I build software that pays attention to context, and I am interested in
        the point where language, judgment, and money meet.
      </p>
      <p class="about__text">
        Most of my work sits in that intersection. ContextOS keeps what an AI
        assistant believes about you under your own control. LedgerGuard stops
        an agent from moving money on a hunch. Kandor is a browser extension
        for online safety. In the lab, I work on how AI-generated content and
        sustainability messaging change the way investors evaluate a venture.
      </p>
      <p class="about__text">
        I am a Computer Science student at Cal Poly Pomona with an Economics
        minor, and I work as a PMO intern and a research assistant. The rest is
        software engineering, teaching math and reading, and music, which is
        where most of my thinking about structure and sound comes from.
      </p>
